The '''Ember Fragment''' is a {{Rare}} item that used to be obtainable from the [[Magma Cube Boss]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Mob Drops ===
'''Ember Fragments''' used to be obtainable by killing the [[Magma Cube Boss (Old)|Magma Cube Boss]]. If the player did not drop a piece of {{Item|Ember Armor}} or an {{Item|Ember Rod}}, they would receive {{Green|1-3}} '''Ember Fragments'''.

